                                                "sense_id": "16367b52-c250-373e-a4c9-4892ed56176b",
                                                "text": "Our recent article on the York-Knaresborough-Harrogate branch mentioned that the diesel multiple-units covering the passenger service did so in the course of complicated cyclic diagrams."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "084d42c6-c719-3a04-9997-2e35b16dc2c0",
